      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我忍不住说出了心中的想法。我虽然觉得她资质很好，\n但自己只是平凡的训练员，实在觉得高攀不起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e1274aa5a989648b2a75701b66e52861cdba829525970c97e4b9d82c2d1d044",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
