    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f682415a689167f1b43b90bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见集团的确是相当知名且规模庞大的企业，\n但也绝不是难以亲近的对象。会特地举办训练员征选──",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ea2ae8c32c0842699bf14cb1827cb3a6cfbcfe14f56bdac00d50f7bdc3be77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
