      "uid": "zhcn:39fb50b8f65944dd4d3df29b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是赛马娘业界独有的文化。若能培育出大量知名赛马娘，\n那将会成为任何事都难以取代，最重要的贡献呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dec6b2092a50518e5a58310db0fc1fa5b41e18aa62ec6a58669c81d9a75e9b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
