    {
      "uid": "zhcn:367609a0a8f734da8e5ef197",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "亲自背负这个重大期望的期待新星就是她，这位里见光钻。\n训练员征选会，也是为了找到能够协助并支持她的人而举办的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a47c601e9545d1c3ad84448e381da7bda336c622913da5e2ddef7dccc3917c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
