      "uid": "zhcn:7f28191d323357d29043ee69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦～由目白家举办的便服派对啊。\n真的很感激他们经常主办各种活动呢。你也会去吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2af51060e7b1410acf58ba927e5a3911bc633187cbbb6cc5c05630c34808db6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
