    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f6dfb2919cb7ee0f9be87cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见集团这么做不是为了要居高临下，\n而是他们真的非常迫切地需要这样的人，没错吧？里见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5744a1a9081926c2984a706c865fcf5acaf6888e88aadaebdb6120384b3294fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
