    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da8df99e19a715938bbdd914",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，请你告诉我，你对我的表现有何看法？\n我真的很在意那天你有话想说的眼神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac83b1aef98e7f8c25c9337d2a6827f89364bbbd48a399752adabcd37d562300",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cdfcca0f64e029e29f256b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的表情看起来非常认真。耿直的眼神，\n诉说着她仅是为了实现目标而想知道答案……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b709d7dd7dc351aa3e4ddac3dd6544eb6ad1b6f77e024ddc6e9ac931509c1d12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90ffb5a30d8304f785c23ffd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先，你认真与人竞争的经验还不够",
      "source_fingerprint": "c009c3fff4cfa7a70ffedfbb228bb884590f31cfe2db492709fd0795c079b920",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:182b72b6a07d88b3785007c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要是拒绝回答就太失礼了。我决定先如实地赞赏她的才能──\n并将我认为她接下来需要克服的问题告诉她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bff82eb85b28e0ac3ba5593f92bdf17d14f3b20ec3159083edb7fdcdacddf11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
